{%- comment -%}
  NO REVIEW OR RATING CLAIMS IN THIS SECTION.

  Until 2026-07-31 this block published "4.9/5 Average product rating",
  "150+ UK review mentions", and three testimonials attributed to invented
  people ("Sarah M. - Dog owner", "James R.", "Priya K.") carrying five-star
  ratings and "Verified buyer" badges. None of it was real. The store had a
  single order on record at the time.

  That is fabricated social proof, and it is a named root cause of the Google
  Merchant Center Misrepresentation suspension. It also breaks the store's own
  standing rule that customer-facing copy must be grounded in a source and
  never invented.

  Everything below is a statement about how this store OPERATES, which is
  verifiable from the policy pages linked in the footer. If real reviews are
  collected later, they belong here with a real source attached - not
  reconstructed from memory of what this section used to say.
{%- endcomment -%}
